<li>&quot;Most begin exhibiting uncharacteristically abusive behavior towards family and close friends. Some attempt to commit acts of mass violence, such as a mass shooting or public bombing, generally planned in a manner which minimizes fatalities but maximizes injuries and induced panic. &quot; Could be rewritten, maybe like this: &quot;Most individuals at this stage begin exhibiting uncharacteristically abusive behavior towards people in their lives while some go as far as to commit acts of mass violence (e.g. a mass shooting, a public bombing). These acts of mass or individual terrorism focus not on fatalities, but instead on injuries; panic; and overall stress.&quot;</li>
</ul>
<p>I would do more constructive stuff, but it's super late. Good work!</p>

