			<div class="content" id="post-content-4064899">
									

<p>My own bias aside, the advice I can give you is to keep in mind that you not saying it doesn't mean that it isn't there. The article shouldn't have so much things thrown in if they are not relevant to the story being told here, but your headcanon for the object can still include those bits.</p>
<p>And then, you can later add them through other works, expanding on your own creation. You can keep record of what you want to be in the skip, and use those as seeds and guides for what you'll do next.</p>

