<p>That's an interesting way of thinking about it. My take would be that PTSD is when the system that makes you averse to things that have scared you before gets overstimulated to the point that it isn't able to work productively anymore, sort of like diabetes or allergies.</p>
<p>The Foundation definitely suspects the Wild God exists, but as far as they can tell he's only been seen in hallucinations and dreams, so they don't really know how to investigate.</p>

